640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/bear-hugger-snes-960x540.jpg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/bear-hugger-snes-160x90.jpg 160w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/bear-hugger-snes.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Ce redoutable boxeur de la s\u00e9rie Punch-Out est \u00e0 l&rsquo;image du st\u00e9r\u00e9otype que les \u00e9trangers s&rsquo;imaginent \u00eatre le canadien moyen : une sorte de b\u00fbcheron vivant dans le bois. Et on sait comment <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=XuSpZ3_5pTc\">Justin Trudeau aime la boxe.<\/a> Pourquoi pas?<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2>Candy Cane<\/h2>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-34705\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"top gouverneur g\u00e9n\u00e9ral\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-500x281.jpg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-640x360.jpg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-960x540.jpg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane-160x90.jpg 160w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/candy-cane.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Beaucoup de grands lutteurs viennent du Canada, et c&rsquo;est \u00e9galement le cas de Candy Cane, issue de la franchise de jeux de lutte Rumble Roses.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2>Wolverine<\/h2>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-34708\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"top gouverneur g\u00e9n\u00e9ral\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-500x281.jpg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-640x360.jpg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-960x540.jpg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine-160x90.jpg 160w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/wolverine.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Wolverine est avant tout un personnage de comic books, mais on l&rsquo;a \u00e9galement vu dans une panoplie de jeux vid\u00e9o de Marvel. Il est probablement le canadien fictif le plus reconnaissable au monde! C&rsquo;est le parfait candidat.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2>Scott Pilgrim<\/h2>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-34706\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"top gouverneur g\u00e9n\u00e9ral\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-500x281.jpg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-640x360.jpg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-960x540.jpg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim-160x90.jpg 160w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/scott-pilgrim.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Le jeu vid\u00e9o Scott Pilgrim vs The World, inspir\u00e9 d&rsquo;une s\u00e9rie de BD du m\u00eame nom, a atteint un statut culte et ce n&rsquo;est pas pour rien qu&rsquo;il est de retour sur toutes les consoles actuelles. Apr\u00e8s avoir combattu les 7 m\u00e9chants ex de Ramona Flowers, Scott Pilgrim est \u00e0 la recherche de nouveaux d\u00e9fis. Peut-\u00eatre que Justin Trudeau le nommera au poste de gouverneur g\u00e9n\u00e9ral?<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2>Trevor Philips<\/h2>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-34707\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/trevor-philips-gta-v-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"top gouverneur g\u00e9n\u00e9ral\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/trevor-philips-gta-v-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/trevor-philips-gta-v-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/01\/trevor-philips-gta-v-500x281.jpg 500